# ===== 敏感信息（绝不入库）=====
# 安卓发布密钥：泄露＝别人能签出冒充本应用的包。真身在仓库外，通过仓库 Secret 注入 CI
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore-password.txt
deploy/.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ===== 依赖与构建产物（体积大且可重建）=====
node_modules/
dist/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/schemas/
# tauri-plugin 的 build 脚本每次构建都会重新生成（本地 cargo check 也会），不入库
desktop/src-tauri/plugins/*/permissions/autogenerated/
desktop/src-tauri/plugins/*/permissions/schemas/

# ===== 运行时数据 =====
*.db
*.sqlite*
data/

# ===== 系统杂项 =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
desktop/src-tauri/gen/android/
desktop/src-tauri/gen/apple/
desktop/apk-out/
server/ivnote-server
